        {
          "id": "2118336734719021249",
          "author": "ryanlanciaux",
          "text": "It's so obnoxious. I have a much much smaller reach and any of my posts that get outside normal follower band gets some AI reply bots. \n\nI don't understand what the people running the account think it does for them. It's so so easy to spot too. \n\n\"here's a complete regurgitation of your post but with strong AI tells.\" \n\nALSO not sure what the platform gains by allowing this. Maybe they're working on a fix but I keep wondering if it's going to get to a point where people leave / lock down the conversation (hurting conversation) / etc. Basically it seems on a long enough timeframe it hurts the platform more than the money they get from the people paying for the $8/month bot account.",
          "text_zh": "太烦人了。我的触达小得多，但只要帖子超出平常粉丝圈，就会冒出一些 AI 回复机器人。不懂这些人开号图什么，而且特别好认：“把你的帖子完整复述一遍，但带着明显的 AI 痕迹。”也不确定平台允许这事有什么好处。也许在修，但我一直担心最终会有人离开 / 锁帖（伤害讨论）等。长期看对平台伤害可能大于每月 8 美元的机器人账号收入。"
        }
